    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS, 1 Capel Street ... are delighted to present Apartment 3, Friary Close to the rental market. This beautifully presented and recently renovated two-bedroom, first-floor apartment offers bright, modern and comfortable living in a superbly convenient Dublin 8 location.\r\n\r\nFreshly painted throughout and thoughtfully upgraded, this impressive home is ready for its new tenants. The property features a beautiful modern kitchen, a newly tiled bathroom and fresh contemporary finishes throughout, creating a warm and stylish living environment.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 67 sq. mtrs. / 721 sq. ft., the accommodation is arranged over two levels. The first floor comprises an entrance hall, bright and spacious living/dining area and a separate kitchen. Upstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms and a newly tiled bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is situated within a well-maintained gated development, which benefits from a private inner courtyard and double electric gates providing access to the car park. The established residential surroundings offer a pleasant sense of privacy and security while being just moments from the city centre.\r\n\r\nThe location is a particular highlight. Friary Close is ideally positioned in the heart of Dublin 8, with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops and everyday amenities close by. The property is within easy reach of some of Dublin's most popular city-centre destinations, including St Stephen's Green, Grafton Street, Christchurch, St Patrick's Cathedral, the Liberties, Guinness Storehouse and the surrounding historic areas of Dublin 8.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the property is exceptionally well positioned, with excellent public transport options nearby. Heuston Station is within easy reach, while the Red and Green LUAS lines provide convenient connections across the city and beyond. Numerous Dublin Bus routes operate in the surrounding area, and Dublin Bikes are also readily available, making commuting around Dublin particularly convenient.\r\n\r\nThe nearby St James's Hospital, Heuston Station, city-centre offices, colleges, shops and amenities make this an ideal home for tenants looking for the convenience of having everything close at hand.\r\n\r\nWith its freshly painted interiors, renovated kitchen, newly tiled bathroom, two double bedrooms and outstanding central location, Apartment 3, Friary Close offers an excellent opportunity to secure a comfortable and stylish long-term home in one of Dublin's most convenient locations.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential and highly recommended. Viewing is strictly by appointment with Gosia Nowicka MIPAV MMCEPI, PSRA Licence number 001747-009962, MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS Capel Street Branch on 01-8844690. \r\n\r\nOverall area approx. 67 sq. mtrs. / 721 sq. ft.\r\n\r\nPlease note all measurements and floor plans are approximate and provided for guidance only.\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. The utmost care has been taken in preparing these particulars; however, the firm does not hold itself responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising. All prospective tenants are advised to satisfy themselves regarding any information contained herein and to obtain specialist advice where appropriate."
      }
